query Props($input: ProposalsInput!) {
  proposals(input: $input) {
    nodes { ... on Proposal {
      id onchainId status quorum createdAt chainId
      governor { id }
      start { ... on Block { number timestamp } ... on BlocklessTimestamp { timestamp } }
      end { ... on Block { number timestamp } ... on BlocklessTimestamp { timestamp } }
      voteStats { type votesCount votersCount percent }
      events { type createdAt }
      metadata { title description }
    } }
    pageInfo { lastCursor }
  }
}

metadata.description:
# Surfing on Entropy | Unlocking AI Story Based Education
**Our Journey**

Our journey began when we were looking for a different way for storytelling to connect the fragmented online experience. There were whispers of access to sovereign communities deep into the Web3 space. Composable and modular elements that allotted the interoperability necessary to form a new phase of stories, transmission content. Configuring itself for discoverability within the ecosystem, transmission content shares the information required to achieve a fundamental perspective within the story content. Fusing lore, stories, games, and education we developed and improved our framework. A space where AI agents and achievements are unlocked and authenticated through the on-chain process of the Web3 ecosystem.&#x20;

Continuing to look forward, it only makes sense for us to apply for a Unlock DAO grant, as we are currently using the Protocol for our Web3 storytelling experience called Surfing On Entropy. This project is focused on story and using AI agents and NFTs utility to move people through the experience within the Web3 modularity protocols. It involves a similar modular approach by building the audience as the story unfolds in real-time; creating within the transmission content a biosphere colony of avid supporters, creators, and developers that believe the power of story can shift perspectives and produce better opportunities through education.&#x20;

**The Future** &#x20;

Our current grant request is for building out the first story pod for Unlock Protocol. If the engagement criteria eclipses the our metrics then we would like to continue discussions for further grants for Phase 1 and possibly our Surfing on Entropy project. We believe this provides a clear and sustainable path towards establishing a long term partnership with Unlock Protocol and developing it's education initiatives with our platform.&#x20;

Looking at the current roadmap we’ve identified 3 specific phases for development of the Web3 education story experience to determine these Unlock educational milestones:  &#x20;

Month 1 - Writing: Rubrics, story design, and instructions

&#x9;⁃	Define Unlock Protocol topics to cover

&#x9;⁃	Design story elements to fit within the topics

&#x9;⁃	Write story elements and content with instructions&#x20;

Month 2 - Development: Assets

&#x9;⁃	Develop environments and content

&#x20;       ⁃	Design and develop AI assistants and agents

&#x9;⁃	Use AI and 3D software to immerse players into the story world

&#x9;⁃	Shoot, edit and sound design for any visual content &#x20;

&#x9;⁃	Design UI and build out story webpages&#x20;

Month 3 - Creation: NFTs and Unlocks&#x20;

&#x9;⁃	Create NFT art

&#x9;⁃	Integrate Unlock Protocol into website&#x20;

&#x9;⁃	Beta Test Product&#x20;

&#x9;⁃	Launch!&#x20;

**Grant Request: Unlocking Your Journey in Web3**&#x20;

We are currently super excited as the project had our first [Beta Tests](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gaVETnK5kI87nZZxwwYvEe39XjLytpbx/view?usp=sharing "Video") on 4/26 so we are in the final stages before launching. We look forward to gathering more feedback as we approach that time to share with everyone.&#x20;

This current grant proposal we are currently requesting 1,000 UDT and 1,000 ARB tokens to help support this project in it's current form. This will help cover the development, AI API start costs for this pod, and the costs associated with building this project and get the it over the finish line.&#x20;



Thanks for your consideration!&#x20;
